%% Infinity-Context v1.2.0 candidate; no provider cache-hit guarantee.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Active: Initialize head and policy
  Active --> Active: Accumulate pending frames below configured threshold
  Active --> Seal: Threshold reached (default 4096) or explicit fold
  Seal --> ColdHistory: Seal immutable epoch; retain recoverable CAS history
  ColdHistory --> Active: Start next active epoch
  Active --> Select: Assemble managed window
  ColdHistory --> Select: Select sealed frames that fit policy
  Select --> Tail: Reserve head and whole recent frames; fit useful whole tail frames
  Tail --> Emit: Compact handles when needed; queue unsent bus events
  Emit --> Active: Return bounded managed text
  note right of Select
    Default context 32768, completion 4096, external 4096.
    Managed allowance 24576 UTF-8 bytes.
    One byte per conservative token allowance.
    Caller budgets external instructions, current message and tools.
  end note
  note right of ColdHistory
    Cold bytes remain immutable.
    Budgeted selection or policy changes may invalidate provider prefixes.
    Provider requests and native host transcripts are not fully bounded here.
  end note
